# Cloudflare Pages redirects — www.pressgangmutiny.com
# Format: <from>  <to>  <status>
# Hugo copies everything in static/ verbatim into public/, which is what
# Cloudflare Pages publishes. Push to main is the only thing that deploys this.

# Singing Tattoo — Stefan's ask, 12 Aug 2026.
# 302 and not 301 on purpose: the target is a Tailscale Funnel URL on a personal
# machine, so it is likely to move. Browsers cache a 301 hard and would strand
# anyone who hit it once. Change the target here and push; nothing else to do.
/singingtattoo    https://threadripper-wsl.taila3ab90.ts.net/pressgang  302
/singingtattoo/   https://threadripper-wsl.taila3ab90.ts.net/pressgang  302
/singingtattoo/*  https://threadripper-wsl.taila3ab90.ts.net/pressgang  302

# EPK — the page lives at /press-kit/ and the nav points there, but /epk/ is the
# URL people type and the one old links use. It was returning 200 with the wrong
# page, which reads as working and isn't. 301 and not 302: same site, stable
# path, and we want search engines to collapse the two.
/epk     /press-kit/  301
/epk/    /press-kit/  301
/epk/*   /press-kit/  301
